Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.48,0:02:39.22,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}It's here somehow
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.27,0:02:41.43,op,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Maybe this is your …
