Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.95,0:12:18.10,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}It's a war out there everyday
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:20.47,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}You can't hide from it, gotta play
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.47,0:12:21.13,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}by the rules
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.13,0:12:21.76,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}play it cool
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:23.03,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}gotta laugh in the face
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.03,0:12:24.20,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}of the sad disgrace
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.20,0:12:27.15,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}when your friends and foes look alike on the face of it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.42,0:12:28.70,in,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}they missed their history
